{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45476","headline":"和王季文题九华山 · 神颖","name":"和王季文题九华山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衆岳雄分野，九华镇南朝。\n彩笔凝空远，崔嵬寄青霄。\n龙潭古仙府，灵药今不凋。\n莹爲沧海镜，烟霞作荒标。\n造化心数奇，性状精气饶。\n玉树郁玲珑，天籁韵萧寥。\n寂寂寻乳窦，兢兢行石桥。\n通泉漱云母，藉草萦香苕。\n我住幽且深，君赏昏复朝。\n稀逢发清唱，片片霜凌飙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"神颖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45476.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45476","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}